/E (Ranked among the nation's top schools in Chemical Engineering, Chmical Engineering at IITK offers arguably the most rigorous undergraduate and graduate programs to prepare competent and confident graduates, ready to take up challenging professional roles in the industry. Our core strengths are the nation's best students enrolling in our programs, distinguished faculty of international standing and state-of-the-art research and pedagogical infrastructure. Their juxtaposition fosters an academic environment that nurtures higher order thinking skills, creativity and innovation beyond traditional boundaries.)
